sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant Front
    participant Amplify
    participant Cognito
    participant Back

    Customer->>+Front: Fill up sign-up form
    Front->>Front: storeProfile()
    Front-->>-Customer: Password form
    Customer->>+Front: Define password
    Front->>Amplify: signUp()
    Amplify->>+Cognito: signUp()
    Cognito->>Cognito: Send confirmation email
    Cognito-->>-Front: [customer cognito profile created]
    Front-->>-Customer: Email confirmation form
    Customer->>+Front: Confirm Email
    Front->>Amplify: confirmSignUp()
    Amplify->>Cognito: confirmSignUp()
    Cognito-->>Front: [sign-up confirmed]
    Front->>Amplify: signIn()
    Amplify->>Cognito: signIn()
    Cognito-->>Front: [sign-in confirmed: token]
    Front->>Back: signUp() - POST /profile
    Back-->>Front: [201 - profile created]
    Front->>Front: remove stored profile
    Front-->>-Customer: Sign-up confirmation
